cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PolyzyMD in work you publish, please cite it as below."
title: "PolyzyMD: a toolkit for enzyme-polymer conjugate molecular dynamics"
abstract: >-
  PolyzyMD builds, runs and analyses molecular dynamics simulations of
  enzyme-polymer conjugates. Its analysis module treats the replicate as the
  sampling unit and follows the LiveCoMS best practices for quantifying
  sampling quality and uncertainty.
type: software
version: 1.3.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/joelaforet/polyzymd"
url: "https://github.com/joelaforet/polyzymd"
authors:
